turn quick prototypes into production-grade systems.",[269,277,279],{"id":278},"core-components","Core Components",[281,282,283,291,296,302],"ul",{},[284,285,286,290],"li",{},[287,288,289],"strong",{},"Kinotic Apps"," -- Applications that run on Kinotic OS. Today, Kinotic Apps are built with TypeScript running on Bun -- you write standard TypeScript for domain models, business logic, and UI, and the platform handles infrastructure, deployment, and scaling. Support for Go, Java, and Python backends is coming soon.",[284,292,293,295],{},[287,294,166],{}," -- The cloud operating system that runs your apps. It provides authentication, authorization, persistence, service mesh, observability, and deployment infrastructure out of the box.",[284,297,298,301],{},[287,299,300],{},"Kinotic OS Cloud"," -- A fully managed SaaS offering of Kinotic OS. No servers to provision, no infrastructure to maintain.",[284,303,304,307],{},[287,305,306],{},"Kinotic CLI"," -- The developer tool that ties it all together. Use it to initialize projects, define entities, generate service code, and deploy applications.",[269,309,311],{"id":310},"why-kinotic","Why Kinotic?",[313,314,315,331],"table",{},[316,317,318],"thead",{},[319,320,321,325,328],"tr",{},[322,323,324],"th",{},"Concern",[322,326,327],{},"Without Kinotic",[322,329,330],{},"With Kinotic",[332,333,334,346,361,372,383],"tbody",{},[319,335,336,340,343],{},[337,338,339],"td",{},"Authentication & Authorization",[337,341,342],{},"Wire up OIDC and session management yourself",[337,344,345],{},"Built in -- configure once, enforce everywhere",[319,347,348,350,353],{},[337,349,84],{},[337,351,352],{},"Choose a database, write migrations, build CRUD endpoints",[337,354,355,356,360],{},"Define entities, run ",[357,358,359],"code",{},"kinotic sync",", get a full service layer",[319,362,363,366,369],{},[337,364,365],{},"Service Mesh",[337,367,368],{},"Deploy sidecars, configure routing, handle retries",[337,370,371],{},"Automatic service discovery and RPC across the application",[319,373,374,377,380],{},[337,375,376],{},"CI\u002FCD",[337,378,379],{},"Maintain pipelines, container registries, rollout strategies",[337,381,382],{},"Handled by the platform",[319,384,385,387,390],{},[337,386,203],{},[337,388,389],{},"Instrument code, deploy collectors, build dashboards",[337,391,392],{},"SBOM generation, metrics, and tracing are included",[265,394,395,398],{},[287,396,397],{},"Rapid prototyping."," Go from an idea to a running application in minutes with the CLI and generated services.",[265,400,401,404],{},[287,402,403],{},"Enterprise-ready."," Software bill of materials and full observability mean you never have to rewrite for production.",[265,406,407,410],{},[287,408,409],{},"Internet scale."," The platform is designed to scale horizontally from day one.",[269,412,414],{"id":413},"what-these-docs-cover","What These Docs Cover",[265,416,417],{},"This documentation walks through everything you need to build and ship a Kinotic App:",[419,420,421,426,432,437,442,447],"ol",{},[284,422,423,425],{},[287,424,15],{}," -- Run Kinotic on your machine and build your first app with Claude Code.",[284,427,428,431],{},[287,429,430],{},"Application Structure"," -- Understand how organizations, applications, projects, and artifacts fit together.",[284,433,434,436],{},[287,435,63],{}," -- Publish and consume services across your application.",[284,438,439,441],{},[287,440,84],{}," -- Define entities, configure indexes, and run queries.",[284,443,444,446],{},[287,445,117],{}," -- Set up authentication and authorization.",[284,448,449,451],{},[287,450,126],{}," -- Ship your application to Kinotic OS or Kinotic OS Cloud.",[265,453,454,455,458],{},"Ready to build something? Head to the ",[456,457,15],"a",{"href":16}," to create your first Kinotic App.",{"title":460,"searchDepth":461,"depth":461,"links":462},"",2,[463,464,465,466],{"id":271,"depth":461,"text":272},{"id":278,"depth":461,"text":279},{"id":310,"depth":461,"text":311},{"id":413,"depth":461,"text":414},"Learn what Kinotic is, why it exists, and how it helps developers and AI agents build enterprise-grade applications at scale.","md",null,{},true,{"title":11,"description":467},"KpL0zILscU1MLkU-cxbQcYvdUFNYvlRGMzTjCuoMizk",[469,475],{"title":15,"path":16,"stem":17,"description":476,"children":-1},"Run Kinotic on your own machine, create your organization, and build your first app with Claude Code.",1793108855652]